    <!-- Room Acoustic Auto-EQ Wizard -->
    <string name="room_wizard_title">Auto-EQ &amp; Acoustic Calibration</string>
    <string name="room_wizard_setup_desc">Calibrated sweeps through each speaker to calculate delays, crossover, and 16-band Auto-EQ.\n⚠️ Media playback will be paused, and volume will be temporarily locked to 16 units (~50%). Keep doors and windows closed.</string>
    <string name="room_wizard_subwoofer_title">Subwoofer Configuration</string>
    <string name="room_wizard_subwoofer_check">Audio system includes a Subwoofer</string>
    <string name="room_wizard_subwoofer_desc">With a subwoofer, door midbasses are protected by HPF cutoff at their acoustic roll-off point, and sub-bass is routed to the subwoofer. Without a subwoofer, midbasses play full-range with infrasonic protection.</string>
    <string name="room_wizard_target_title">Target Sound Profile</string>
